# Fallout 3's opening on Fallout 4, part 4: CG03, Future Imperfect (the G.O.A.T., age 16).
# CG02 stage 100 starts CG03; its 0 moves the player to CG03StartMarkerREF and sets 5 (NPCs enabled, the clock
# set). Dad talks, then force greets; leaving him says his GOODBYE line, which sets 10. In the hall the player walks into
# Amata's trigger (15); she meets the Tunnel Snakes (20, 25) and the player talks Butch away (30). Mr. Brotch
# starts the G.O.A.T. (40, 42), the player sits (50), everyone sits (55, 60), his speech asks ten questions, each a
# CG03Script message box (ShowMessage, GetButtonPressed), then 70. His result line sets 80 and SetTagSkills 3.
# Leaving through Freddie's trigger sets 90; CG03Script's timer, 100, starts CG04.
# Source refs (Fallout3.esm): Dad 01CE3A, Amata 01CE25, Butch 01CE27, Mr. Brotch 01CFB8, Amata's move trigger
# 057AEB, Freddie's trigger 02B797; the classroom's eight desks (seven students) 02B793 02B790 02B78D 02B765
# 02B5C8 02B5C7 034209 021425. See docs/fork/fo4_opening_progression_plan.md#cases-fo3.

case cg03_dad
until 120 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 5 == 1                # CG02 100 starts CG03: the start marker, the NPCs enabled
menu 180 DialogueMenu                                 # Dad's speech (6), then his force greet (CG03DadRef.evp)
choose 60 If you say so, Dad.                         # CG03DadChoice1: "Hey, it's not my call. Those are the rules."
choose 60 [Leave]                                     # leaving says his GOODBYE line "Bye, Dad." (SetStage CG03 10)
until 60 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 10 == 1
closed 30 DialogueMenu
end

case cg03_amata
walk 120 {Fallout3.esm:057AEB}                        # CG03AmataMoveTrigger: 15, Amata heads for the Tunnel Snakes
until 30 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 15 == 1
until 120 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 20 == 1               # she reaches CG03AmataTeasingTrigger
until 120 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 25 == 1               # CG03BullyIntroConv between Amata and Butch
end

case cg03_butch
walk 60 {Fallout3.esm:01CE27} 200
talk 60 {Fallout3.esm:01CE27}
choose 60 Looks like you're having fun.               # CG03ButchChoiceSpeech
choose 60 If you keep messing with her, the Overseer is going to come down on your gang.
until 60 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 30 == 1                # "Maybe you're right. We can deal with her later." (01CDEC)
bye
end

case cg03_brotch
walk 120 {Fallout3.esm:01CFB8} 200
talk 60 {Fallout3.esm:01CFB8}
choose 60 Sure, I'm ready. I bet I'll ace it!         # CG03BrotchStartA3: 40 and 42
until 60 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 42 == 1
bye
end

case cg03_sit
until 120 {Fallout3.esm:01CE25}.GetSitting == 3       # the students first: their Find packages pick any free seat, so
until 120 {Fallout3.esm:01CE27}.GetSitting == 3       # which one is left changes from run to run, and a student whose
until 120 {Fallout3.esm:01CE29}.GetSitting == 3       # found seat the player takes stands for good (open:
until 120 {Fallout3.esm:01CE2B}.GetSitting == 3       # fo4_opening_progression_plan.md#seat-taken)
until 120 {Fallout3.esm:01D029}.GetSitting == 3
until 120 {Fallout3.esm:02B795}.GetSitting == 3
until 120 {Fallout3.esm:034203}.GetSitting == 3
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | walk 30 {Fallout3.esm:02B793} 100    # each seat in turn: up to it, then E (a
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | activate {Fallout3.esm:02B793}        # taken seat does nothing)
wait 4
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | walk 30 {Fallout3.esm:02B790} 100
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | activate {Fallout3.esm:02B790}
wait 4
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | walk 30 {Fallout3.esm:02B78D} 100
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | activate {Fallout3.esm:02B78D}
wait 4
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | walk 30 {Fallout3.esm:02B765} 100
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | activate {Fallout3.esm:02B765}
wait 4
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | walk 30 {Fallout3.esm:02B5C8} 100
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | activate {Fallout3.esm:02B5C8}
wait 4
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | walk 30 {Fallout3.esm:02B5C7} 100
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | activate {Fallout3.esm:02B5C7}
wait 4
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | walk 30 {Fallout3.esm:034209} 100
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | activate {Fallout3.esm:034209}
wait 4
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | walk 30 {Fallout3.esm:021425} 100
unless player.GetSitting == 3 | activate {Fallout3.esm:021425}
wait 4
check until 30 player.GetSitting == 3                 # set aside: run 2026-11-24 sat at none of the 8 desks
unless GetStageDone FNV_CG03 50 == 1 | run setstage FNV_CG03 50    # so the run reaches CG04; `report` still fails it
until 120 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 50 == 1               # CG03ClassroomTrigger: sitting at 40
check until 300 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 60 == 1         # Brotch walks in (55); every student seated: 60
unless GetStageDone FNV_CG03 60 == 1 | run setstage FNV_CG03 60    # the player never sat (above)
until 30 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 60 == 1
end

case cg03_goat
answer 240 "Yeah? Up yours too, buddy!"               # each box after Brotch's question line (CG03GoatQuestion01-10)
answer 120 Medicate the infected area to the best of your abilities.
answer 120 Lead the boy to safety, and then turn him in to the Overseer.
answer 120 Catcher.
answer 120 Obey your elder and kill the resident with the pistol.
answer 120 Use a bobby pin to pick the lock on the door.
answer 120 Removal of the mutated tissue with a precision laser.
answer 120 Trade the comic book for one of your own valuable possessions.
answer 120 Loosen the bolts on some pipes. When the sink is turned on, the restroom will flood.
answer 120 The Overseer.
until 180 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 70 == 1               # "You can have the rest of the day off" (034906)
end

case cg03_results
talk 120 {Fallout3.esm:01CFB8}
choose 60 Wow! That's what I've always wanted to be. My dreams are finally coming true!    # CG03BrotchA1
until 60 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 80 == 1
menu 60 CRUI_LevelUp                                  # SetTagSkills 3: our tags menu
wait 2
invoke CRUI_LevelUp ProcessUserEvent XButton 0        # X keeps the three tags the G.O.A.T. suggested
closed 30 CRUI_LevelUp
closed 60 DialogueMenu
end

case cg03_leave
walk 120 {Fallout3.esm:02B797}                        # CG03FreddieBrotchTrigger: 90 at 80
until 30 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 90 == 1
until 120 GetStageDone FNV_CG03 100 == 1              # CG03Script's timer, the player standing: 100 starts CG04
end
